  "verseCount": 31,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "16",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LUK 16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "16",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyasala sala ya nang'hani wa sabo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bahemba bakwe nabo ūbawīla lūsumo; ūhaya gīkī, “Walīho munhū nsabi, walī na nang'hani o sabo jakwe. Ū nang'hani ng'wenūyo ūbūūlwa, gīkī akūjiponanjaga sagala ī sabo ja nsabi ng'wenūyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūng'witana ūmūja gīkī, ‘Bebe mhayo kī ū gwenūyū nandije kwigwa gūkūhayiagwa? Alinoolekejage ū nīmo gwa būlang'hani wako nagūlole ūmo gūlī. Nalībona ī gete ūkūgoya ū nīmo gwenūyū, ū go kūjilang'hana ī sabo jane!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nang'hani o sabo ng'wenūyo wandya kwiwīla gīkī, ‘ī gīsī, nīīte ginehe īkī ū baba būgonzo alīnīnja a ha nīmo? Ū kūlīma nalemeelilwe, ū kwandya kwilombeleja nī chene nalīcha minala! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yū, ī gete namana ū gwa kwīta; ūyo gūkūbīīta bayūneegeleja ū mu kaya jabo ūlū nalīnjiwe a ha nīmo!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna wandya kūbitana ūmò ūmò abo batondagwa magasa nū ise būgonzo. O kwandya ūng'wīla gīkī, ‘Ū bebe, ni ūlī na būgasa kī ng'hana ū kūlī namhala?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūhaya ‘Ngelekelo igana ja maguta.’ Ūng'wīla, ‘Anukūlaga jiiji aha mbapūla jako, wigashe wandīke makūmi atanò; nīyo kangīlījaga.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ūngī ūng'wīla, ‘Al'ū bebe ginehe, ūlī na būgasa kī?’ Ūhaya, ‘Matangwa igana ga būsīga?’ Ūng'wīla, ‘Solaga nang'ho ī mbapūla jako, andīkaga makūmi anaane!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ise būgonzo o nang'hani ū nyeecha ng'wenūyo akankumīlīja, īkī akatūmamīla masala ū kwīyīta ī yenīyo. Nguno a baana ba mu sī bachagūku ū kū mihayo yabo, kūtinda a baana ba ng'wisana ū mu shibyalīlwe shabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalīmuwīla ītūmamīlagi ī sabo ya būnyeecha kwibeegeja būnwani, ūlū yūshila bakūng'wanukūla ū mu wikalo bo welelo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū ūyo alī ng'wishigwa mu shikolo shido ashikile kūsanyiwa nū mu shitaale; alīyo ūyo atī ntūngīlīja mu shido, nū mu shitaale atūbiza ntūngīlīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose lūūlū ūlū ng'ūbiza mutī bishigwa ū kū sabo ya mu sī, nani ūyo alamusanye ū kū sabo ya ng'hana? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na hangī ūlū ng'ūlemeelwa kūbiza bishigwa kū shikolo sha bangī, nani ūyo alang'winhe shikolo shibize shing'we benekīlī? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atīho ntūmami wa mu kaya ūyo adūgije kūbatūmamīla bataale babīlī, nguno adūgije kūnkolwa ūmò wabo, ūntogwa ū ūngī; nūūlū adūgije kwiyigwa nū ūmò, alīyo ū ūngī ūndalaha. Mutūdūla kūntūmamīla ū Mulungu hamò na sabo!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shilagīlo na būtemi bo ng'wa Mulungu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Bafalisayo īkī baalī batogilwe sabo, aho bīyigwa pyī ī yenīyo bakandalaha; bandya kūng'wineenelegeja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūbawīla, “A bing'we angū mukiyoolechaga ū kū banhū gīkī mulī batūngīlīja, alīyo ū Mulungu ajideebile īng'holò jing'we; nguno īsho shikakumīlījiagwa na banhū shilī sha malofu ū kūlī Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shilagīlo na a bahangi, bagelelile halī Yohana; ū kwīngīīla a h'ikanza lyenīlo ū būtemi bo ng'wa Mulungu būkūlomeelagwa, na būlī ng'wene akwigaganījaga ū kwingīla moi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo īlī shinogu ī ligūlū nī sī ū kūbīta, kūtinda kwīnga ho nūūlū kanuguta kadoololo ka shilagīlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munhū ose ose ūlū ūneka nke ūtoola ūngī, akūbiza alīshihya. Nū yūyo alantoole ū nkīma ūyo alekilwe na ngoshi, nang'hwe akūbiza akūshihyaga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nsabi na Lazalo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ali lūūlū, walīho ngosha nsabi, wikalaga azwalile ng'hanjo ya nyasabi ya nzulunge, na shikoye shisoga; walī mu kikalīle ka kūyegela būpanga pyī ī shikū ja būlamu bokwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama walīho na kunese nebe witanagwa Lazalo: Walī okalile malonda pyī ū mīlī. Ū munhū ng'wenūyo wenhagwa wiza watūūlwa ha mita go nsabi ng'wenūyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gīkī ayūpandīka nūūlū malagalīkwa kūfuma a ha meza ya nsabi walya; na mva jizaga ho jayūgalambīla a malonda gakwe! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose ū kunese ng'wenūyo ūcha, ūbūūchiwa na bamalaika; ūūkatūūlwa kū wikalo bo ng'wa Abulahamu. Ū nsabi ng'wenūyo nang'hwe ūcha, ūjīkwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho alī mu kūlimu ūyūluha no, wahayūponya a miso gakwe ūnoleela kūle ū Abulahamu, alī nū Lazalo bigashije dege. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlīla n'ilaka; ūhaya, ‘Baba Abulahamu, nichīlage shigongo, ūntūme ū Lazalo asombye nūūlū lwala lokwe mu minzī alūtwinīje ū lūlīmi lone alūpoje; nguno nalī na makoye no ū mu moto gwenūyū!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Abulahamu ūnshokeja gīkī, ‘Bebe ng'wana, izūkagwa gīkī ū bebe ū mu būpanga wako wapandīkaga ī yako ī misoga. Ū Lazalo nang'hwe wapandīkaga yabūbi, alīyo ī haha nang'hwe alī mu būyegi; ū bebe ūlī mu būluhi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo hangī a higūlya ya yose yenīyī, a ha gatī ying'we na a bise lītūūlilwe ho ishimayenze, nose abo batogilwe kwīnga ū kū lwandī lwise kwiza kū bing'we batūdūla; na a babo batogilwe kwiza kūūnū kūfuma ūko mulī nabo batūdūla.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūng'wīla hangī gīkī, ‘Nahene shi lūūlū baba nalīkwikūmbīlīja, nūūlū ūntūme ū kū kaya ya ng'wa baba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno nalī na baana bang'wise batanò; aje akabahūgūle batiziza nabo ū kūūnū; kūbi no!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
